<title>USA: 360 Communications to resell PageNet service.</title>
<headline>360 Communications to resell PageNet service.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>360 Communications Co said Tuesday it has signed an agreement to resell the paging services of Paging Network Inc (PageNet).</p>
<p>360 Communications will begin sales later this year to new and existing customers, it said. It will sell local, regional and nationwide services.</p>
<p>The decision to sell paging services came after customers requested &quot;one-stop shopping&quot; for communications services, the company said.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
